; Names in the 48 BASIC of the +3 v4.1 ROM 3, where it differs from the
; 48K ROM, for the Xpeccy+ debugger.
;
; Names and data ranges from Klive IDE's ROM annotations, file spp3-41-3.rom.dis
; (https://github.com/Dotneteer/kliveide, src/public/roms, commit e227b87c,
; 2026-11-06), MIT license:
